      <title>India’s Billionaire Family Feuds Need Rules</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-09/india-s-billionaire-family-feuds-need-rules</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">09c12d795b70397d11037c90</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 19:00:13 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>In Chennai, the TVS Group's patriarch filed caveats in court against his wife and daughter, who did the same against him. In New Delhi, the scion of the Godfrey Phillips empire accused his mother of orchestrating an assault on him. Pune’s prominent industrialists, the Kalyanis, took their two-decade-long inheritance dispute to mediation. The list goes on.</description>
